Package: bagfoot2
Title: Differential Transcription Factor Footprinting from ATAC-seq
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Leslie", "Cohen", , "leslie.cohen@mail.huji.ac.il", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts which transcription factors change their activity
    between two conditions from ATAC-seq data, by combining Tn5 bias-corrected
    footprint depth and flanking accessibility over archetype motif clusters,
    with a robust Mahalanobis (MCD) outlier test. Updated implementation of
    BaGFoot (Baek et al., Cell Reports 2017).
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/goldsteinlab-tech/BAGFOOT2
